 Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯云智能体开发平台下调DeepSeek-V4系列模型API价格，最高降幅达97.5%</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">百度发布文心PaddleOCR-VL-1.6模型，准确率达96.33%刷新文档解析SOTA</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">估值近万亿美元！Anthropic秘密申请IPO，奥特曼回应：竞争在于技术</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">软银集团拟投资750亿欧元在法国建设总计5GW规模的超级数据中心群</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ec7a4a5bdde6522dde5ebc0e9eb5277.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">软银集团于5月30日正式宣布，计划在法国投资750亿欧元用于大规模拓展数据中心容量，旨在开发并运营总计5GW的算力基础设施。该项目将分阶段推进，首批建设选址位于敦刻尔克、博斯凯及布尚，预计在2031年前为上法兰西大区提供3.1GW的算力支持。作为OpenAI的核心投资方及技术客户，软银此次布局是其在欧洲大陆最大规模的人工智能基础设施投资。法国经济部表示，该项目是法国建设全球AI价值链核心聚集地的关键里程碑。在全球AI算力军备竞赛背景下，软银通过在欧洲开辟高规格算力战场，将进一步重塑全球大模型算力与具身智能的底层版图，缓解此前在美国本土面临的电网负荷与环境政策压力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达联合清华等机构发布多智能体世界模型Gamma-World</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/698cd3143856dfca64359cc3715c8aab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达联合清华大学、多伦多大学及Vector Institute正式发布多智能体世界模型Gamma-World，旨在解决多智能体虚拟仿真中时间、跨视角及交互的一致性难题。该模型引入“正单纯形旋转智能体编码”，通过几何空间等距布局实现无需额外训练的跨人数泛化；采用“稀疏枢纽注意力机制”替代全连接模式，将计算复杂度降至线性，支持24FPS实时动作推演。训练层面，该方案利用三阶段师生蒸馏法，将多步采样压缩至4步，有效缓解自回归误差累积。在Minecraft场景测试中，Gamma-World的FVD指标较现有模型平均下降超40%。该框架已成功迁移至双臂机器人协同任务，未来有望为多臂医疗、工厂机器人调度及自动驾驶等物理AI领域提供大规模模拟生成基础设施。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云智能体开发平台下调DeepSeek-V4系列模型API价格，最高降幅达97.5%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96e1a439272c9263333d3cd96c192d9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云智能体开发平台宣布，自2026年6月3日零时起，大幅下调DeepSeek-V4系列模型调用价格，实现与官方售价全面持平。此次调价中，DeepSeek-V4-Pro的缓存命中价格降幅高达97.5%，调整为0.000025元/千tokens；其推理输入与输出价格均下调75%，分别降至0.003元/千tokens和0.006元/千tokens。DeepSeek-V4-Flash模型的缓存命中价格亦下调90%，降至0.000025元/千tokens。DeepSeek-V4系列于今年4月24日发布，采用1.6万亿参数的MoE架构，原生支持100万tokens上下文长度。此次价格调整旨在降低开发者使用门槛，通过与官方定价对齐，进一步提升腾讯云在AI模型服务市场的竞争力，助力企业级智能体应用的高效开发与部署。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度发布文心PaddleOCR-VL-1.6模型，准确率达96.33%刷新文档解析SOTA</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e6a57ec4075936d7095676f24577edce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度正式发布文心大模型衍生模型PaddleOCR-VL-1.6，在OmniDocBench v1.6评测中以96.33%的准确率超越Gemini-3-Pro、GPT-5.2及GLM-OCR，刷新业界SOTA。该模型保持0.9B轻量化架构，通过模型驱动的数据构建与渐进式训练优化，显著提升了表格、古籍、生僻字及复杂图表识别能力。在Real5-OmniDocBench评测中，该模型以93.19%的总指标攻克了扫描件、弯折、光照变化及倾斜文档等解析痛点。PaddleOCR-VL-1.6支持超100种语言识别，延续前代架构，支持企业与开发者平滑迁移。目前，该模型已上线官网并开源代码与权重。作为全球最受欢迎的开源OCR项目，PaddleOCR在GitHub上的Star数已达79.2K，此次升级将进一步加速AI在复杂多模态场</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">估值近万亿美元！Anthropic秘密申请IPO，奥特曼回应：竞争在于技术</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/192b5d156e5b359a2ca035977b0fd14b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic秘密申请IPO，奥特曼回应：竞争在于技术AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 2, 202633人工智能领域的资本大战正愈演愈烈。作为 OpenAI 最强劲的竞争对手，AI 独角兽企业 Anthropic 已于周一正式宣布，向美国证券交易委员会秘密提交了首次公开募股（IPO）申请，标志着科技史上最具瞩目的上市浪潮迎来重大里程碑。竞争对手淡化上市争夺 面对竞争对手的率先出击，OpenAI 首席执行官萨姆·奥特曼（Sam Altman）在接受采访时淡化了双方在“争先上市”的说法。他表示，AI 行业最激烈的竞争并不在于谁能率先登陆华尔街，上市仅仅是一个融资事件，公司并不会过度关注具体的时间节点。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
